            "text/plain": "Function: 5\r\nandThen: 16\r\ncompose: 26\r\nConsumer: Hello\r\nConsumer: chain\r\n!CHAIN!\r\nSupplier: 0.31316465053585774\r\nPredicate: true\r\nand: true\r\nor: true\r\nBiFunction: Hello, World\r\nUnaryOperator: JAVA\r\nBinaryOperator max: 7\r\nBinaryOperator min: 3\r\nBiConsumer: age=25\r\nBiPredicate: true\r\nIntFunction: Number: 42\r\nIntConsumer: 10\r\nIntSupplier: 99\r\nIntPredicate: true\r\nIntUnaryOperator: 36\r\nIntBinaryOperator: 7\r\nToIntFunction: 5\r\nToIntBiFunction: 7\r\nIntToLongFunction: 5000000\r\nIntToDoubleFunction: 3.3333333333333335\r\nLongFunction: Long: 100\r\nLongConsumer: 999\r\nLongSupplier: 1777266425820\r\nLongPredicate: true\r\nLongUnaryOperator: 100\r\nLongBinaryOperator: 20\r\nToLongFunction: 3556498\r\nToLongBiFunction: 195\r\nLongToIntFunction: 123456789\r\nLongToDoubleFunction: 15.0\r\nDoubleFunction: 3.14\r\nDoubleConsumer: 2.718\r\nDoubleSupplier: 0.9952271646553906\r\nDoublePredicate: true\r\nDoubleUnaryOperator: 4.0\r\nDoubleBinaryOperator: 1024.0\r\nToDoubleFunction: 3.14\r\nToDoubleBiFunction: 5.0\r\nDoubleToIntFunction: 9\r\nDoubleToLongFunction: 10\r\nBooleanSupplier: true\r\nObjIntConsumer: ababab\r\nObjLongConsumer: timestamp=1777266426148\r\nObjDoubleConsumer: pi=3.14159\r\n"
